; xact.any() and xact.all() are the posting-scope any() and all(): a
; second argument of false leaves the current posting out of the test,
; and a second argument of true keeps it in.

2024/01/01 Split
    A    $1
    B    $2
    C   $-3

test reg --format "%(account) %(xact.all(amount > 0, false)) %(all(amount > 0, false)) %(xact.any(amount < 0, false)) %(any(amount < 0, false)) %(xact.any(amount < 0, true)) %(any(amount < 0))\n"
A false false true true true true
B false false true true true true
C true true false false true true
end test
